# --- anonymizer working files -------------------------------------------------

# Mapping databases hold the DE-ANONYMIZATION KEYS: every pseudonym paired with the
# real team and run name it stands for. Never commit one. Git keeps a committed file
# recoverable long after it is deleted, so a single slip undoes the anonymization for
# every dataset ever built from that mapping.
*.db

# Anonymized output, and the per-run state that produced it.
data/anon/
decisions.yml
*-topic-list.txt
